L07 math spans with raw < before a letter: [(56, '<p>Let \\((X, d)\\) be a metric space, as defined in <a class="concept" data-concept="metric-space" href="L04.html#def-met'), (60, '<p>Let \\(\\beta\\) be a real number with \\(0 < \\beta < 1\\). A map \\(\\varphi \\colon X \\to X\\) is a <dfn id="def-contraction'), (67, '<p>A metric space \\((X, d)\\) is <em>complete</em> when every Cauchy sequence in \\(X\\) converges to a point of \\(X\\). Les'), (160, "<p>If \\(f\\) is continuously differentiable on \\([a, b]\\) and \\(a \\le x \\le y \\le b\\), then \\(f(y) - f(x) = \\int_x^y f'(t"), (172, 'An inequality of this form, with one constant \\(L\\) for all pairs of points, is a <em>Lipschitz bound</em> with constant')]
